The inventory below is information an operator needs: MinusOps shells out to these tools, so their
licenses apply to whoever installs them, not to this repository.

  terraform  - HashiCorp, BUSL-1.1 (>= 1.6) / MPL-2.0 (earlier)
  aws        - AWS CLI, Apache-2.0
  opa        - Open Policy Agent, Apache-2.0        (optional, G6 policy gate)
  checkov    - Bridgecrew/Prisma Cloud, Apache-2.0  (optional, `policy` extra)
  tfsec      - Aqua Security, MIT                   (optional, external scanner)
  opensre    - Tracer Cloud, Apache-2.0             (optional, separately admitted investigator)

Terraform's BUSL-1.1 is the one to read before redistributing a bundle: it
restricts competing hosted offerings. Nothing here bundles, links, or
redistributes any of these binaries.

Optional Python dependencies, installed only with the `dashboard` extra:

  dash       - Plotly, MIT
  plotly     - Plotly, MIT

The base install has no runtime Python dependencies.
